(1. WORKING HOURS AND LEAVE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The standard working week is 38 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Annual leave is 25 working days per year for full-time employees, plus 3 days that must be) Tj T*
(taken between Christmas and New Year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Up to 5 unused leave days can be carried over to the next year and must be used by 31 March.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Parental leave is 16 weeks fully paid for employees with at least 12 months of service.) Tj T*
(Contractors are not eligible for paid parental leave.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Sick leave is 10 paid days per year. A medical certificate is required from the third) Tj T*
(consecutive day of absence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
